{"id":"u131","kelas":"kosa","no":16,"judul":"Kata yang Mirip tetapi Beda Arti","title":"False Friends","emoji":"🪞","ringkas":"actually, eventually, sensible, sympathetic, dan kata yang menjebak","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali **false friends**: kata mirip bahasa Indonesia tetapi arti berbeda","memakai **actually, eventually, sensible, sympathetic, familiar, argument** dengan benar","menebak arti kata dari konteks, bukan dari kemiripan","menghindari salah paham dalam percakapan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"**False friends** adalah kata Inggris yang mirip dengan kata Indonesia (atau kata serapan) tetapi artinya berbeda. Memakainya berdasarkan kemiripan dapat membuat kalimatmu salah atau lucu. Pelajari pasangan berikut."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Kata yang menjebak","items":[{"en":"actually","id":"sebenarnya (bukan 'aktual')","ex":"Actually, I don't like coffee."},{"en":"eventually","id":"akhirnya, pada akhirnya","ex":"Eventually, we found the house."},{"en":"sensible","id":"masuk akal / bijaksana","ex":"That is a sensible idea."},{"en":"sensitive","id":"peka / mudah tersinggung","ex":"She is sensitive to noise."},{"en":"sympathetic","id":"bersimpati, penuh pengertian","ex":"He was sympathetic when I was sick."},{"en":"nice","id":"menyenangkan / baik (untuk 'simpatik')","ex":"She is a nice person."},{"en":"familiar","id":"dikenal, tidak asing","ex":"This song is familiar to me."},{"en":"family","id":"keluarga","ex":"My family lives in Bandung."},{"en":"argument","id":"pertengkaran / alasan","ex":"They had an argument."},{"en":"current","id":"saat ini (bukan 'kurens')","ex":"What is your current job?"},{"en":"terrific","id":"hebat (bukan menakutkan)","ex":"The show was terrific."},{"en":"terrible","id":"buruk sekali","ex":"The weather was terrible."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Pasangan penting","table":[["Kata Inggris","Arti sebenarnya","Bukan"],["**actually**","sebenarnya / ternyata","aktual (= current, latest)"],["**eventually**","akhirnya (setelah lama)","eventual / kejadian"],["**sensible**","masuk akal","sensitif (= sensitive)"],["**sympathetic**","bersimpati","simpatik / ramah (= nice, friendly)"],["**familiar**","dikenal / akrab","famili / keluarga (= family, relatives)"],["**argument**","pertengkaran / alasan","argumen saja"],["**terrific**","hebat","terrible = buruk sekali"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Contoh dalam kalimat","table":[["Maksud","Kalimat yang benar"],["Berita terbaru","[[Here is the latest news.]] (bukan *actual news*)"],["Orang yang ramah","[[He is a friendly person.]] (bukan *sympathetic person*)"],["Ide masuk akal","[[That is a sensible plan.]] (bukan *sensitive plan*)"],["Akhirnya selesai","[[Eventually, I finished the report.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan percaya kemiripan","text":"Jika kata Inggris terlihat seperti kata Indonesia, cek dulu di kamus. Kemiripan ejaan tidak menjamin arti yang sama."},{"t":"summary","items":["actually = sebenarnya, bukan aktual.","eventually = akhirnya.","sensible = masuk akal; sensitive = peka.","sympathetic = bersimpati; ramah = nice/friendly.","familiar = akrab; family = keluarga.","terrific = hebat; terrible = buruk sekali."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"actually\" adalah...","options":["sebenarnya","aktual / terbaru","sangat cepat","selalu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Actually = sebenarnya.","k":"dc4a5046"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"berita terbaru / aktual\" adalah...","options":["latest","actual","actually","eventual"],"answer":0,"exp":"Latest news. Jawaban yang tepat: **latest**.","k":"24d2d214"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"eventually\" adalah...","options":["akhirnya","kejadian","selalu","tiba-tiba"],"answer":0,"exp":"Eventually = pada akhirnya.","k":"c6181d7e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"sensible\" adalah...","options":["masuk akal","peka","sensitif terhadap kritik","berisik"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sensible = masuk akal.","k":"6e4762bd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"sensitive\" adalah...","options":["peka / mudah tersinggung","masuk akal","bijaksana","kuat"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sensitive = peka.","k":"6600afec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"sympathetic\" adalah...","options":["bersimpati","ramah dan menyenangkan","sombong","pendiam"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sympathetic = bersimpati.","k":"6adc910c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk orang yang \"simpatik / ramah\" adalah...","options":["friendly / nice","sympathetic","sensitive","familiar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Friendly person.","k":"190bd47d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"familiar\" adalah...","options":["dikenal / tidak asing","keluarga","sangat besar","baru"],"answer":0,"exp":"Familiar = dikenal.","k":"d6efe1d1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"keluarga\" adalah...","options":["family","familiar","relative","fami"],"answer":0,"exp":"Family. Jawaban yang tepat: **family**.","k":"b9b4c5a7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"argument\" yang paling umum dalam percakapan adalah...","options":["pertengkaran","ringkasan","pidato","ujian"],"answer":0,"exp":"Had an argument.","k":"4d0f914d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"current\" adalah...","options":["saat ini","arus listrik saja","dulu","nanti"],"answer":0,"exp":"Current job = pekerjaan saat ini.","k":"020d986e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"terrific\" adalah...","options":["hebat","menakutkan","buruk sekali","membosankan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terrific = hebat.","k":"39b6c8a8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"terrible\" adalah...","options":["buruk sekali","hebat","terlalu besar","sangat kecil"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terrible = sangat buruk.","k":"beaf097c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"___, I don't agree with you.\" (sebenarnya)","options":["Actually","Actual","Eventually","Currently"],"answer":0,"exp":"Actually, ...","k":"1d81f12e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"It took years, but ___ she became a doctor.\"","options":["eventually","actually","sensibly","usually"],"answer":0,"exp":"Akhirnya. Kalimat lengkap: **It took years, but eventually she became a doctor.**","k":"89e884b9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"That is a very ___ idea; it will save money.\"","options":["sensible","sensitive","sympathetic","familiar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Masuk akal. Kalimat lengkap: **That is a very sensible idea; it will save money.**","k":"a9462ae2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"She is very ___ about her weight; do not joke about it.\"","options":["sensitive","sensible","familiar","terrific"],"answer":0,"exp":"Peka. Kalimat lengkap: **She is very sensitive about her weight; do not joke about it.**","k":"e08af7ad"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"He was very ___ when I lost my job.\"","options":["sympathetic","sensitive","familiar","terrible"],"answer":0,"exp":"Bersimpati. Kalimat lengkap: **He was very sympathetic when I lost my job.**","k":"d2f9f6d3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"Your face looks ___. Have we met before?\"","options":["familiar","family","fatal","fabulous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Familiar = tidak asing.","k":"6ea06ea6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"My ___ has four members.\"","options":["family","familiar","familiarity","famed"],"answer":0,"exp":"Family = keluarga.","k":"53a37686"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"What is your ___ address?\" (alamat saat ini)","options":["current","actual","actually","eventual"],"answer":0,"exp":"Current = saat ini.","k":"48fb7476"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"The concert was ___! We loved it.\"","options":["terrific","terrible","terrify","terror"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terrific = hebat.","k":"4fdb41c7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"The food was ___; nobody finished it.\"","options":["terrible","terrific","terrifying","terror"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terrible = buruk sekali.","k":"288b0f22"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["She is a very sympathetic person, and everyone likes her smile.","She is a very friendly person.","She is very nice.","She was kind to me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Untuk ramah, pakai friendly/nice.","k":"518b8895"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["Here is the actual news from yesterday.","Here is the latest news from yesterday.","Here is the news.","Here is the current news."],"answer":0,"exp":"Aktual = latest/current.","k":"e2de3591"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"eventually\" adalah...","options":["akhirnya","segera","selalu","kadang-kadang"],"answer":0,"exp":"Eventually. Jawaban yang tepat: **akhirnya**.","k":"830418ba"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"sensible\" adalah...","options":["masuk akal","peka","cepat","mahal"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sensible. Jawaban yang tepat: **masuk akal**.","k":"b8e88ae9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"familiar\" adalah...","options":["dikenal","keluarga","asing","cepat"],"answer":0,"exp":"Familiar. Jawaban yang tepat: **dikenal**.","k":"fe17acc8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"actually\" adalah...","options":["sebenarnya","terbaru","segera","akhirnya"],"answer":0,"exp":"Actually. Jawaban yang tepat: **sebenarnya**.","k":"8bf5b0ba"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"He is a ___ boy; everybody likes him.\"","options":["nice","sympathetic","sensitive","actual"],"answer":0,"exp":"Nice = baik/ramah.","k":"bdcb14b2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"We had a big ___ about money.\"","options":["argument","argue","arguing","argues"],"answer":0,"exp":"Had an argument.","k":"d759bcd4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang SALAH:","options":["The party was terrible; it was a great success.","The party was terrific.","The party was terrible.","The party was great."],"answer":0,"exp":"Terrible dan great bertentangan.","k":"c7590e99"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar: \"___, he arrived at ten.\" (sebenarnya, ternyata)","options":["Actually","Eventual","Current","Sensible"],"answer":0,"exp":"Actually. Kalimat lengkap: **Actually, he arrived at ten.**","k":"3708a429"}],"read":[]}